# The handbook's build output and dependency tree. Listed here rather than in a
# docs-site/.gitignore, because ESLint and Prettier both read the *root* ignore
# file only — a nested one keeps git happy and still leaves 2500 lint errors in
# generated JavaScript, which is how this was found.
docs-site/node_modules
docs-site/build
docs-site/.docusaurus
